// ...
if err := StoreRepoMissingLFSObjects(ctx, r, d.db, d.store, client); err != nil {
```

`lfs.NewEndpoint` does URL parsing only -- no SSRF validation. `lfs.NewClient` calls `newHTTPClient`.

