  -H "Content-Type: application/json" -H "x-csrf-token: $CSRF" \
  -d '{"url":"https://../../../tmp/pmf-poc/"}'
```

The server computes `$sourcePath = '../../../tmp/pmf-poc/'`, concatenates to `<clientFolder>/`, and recursively deletes the resulting path.

